Iridium Version: 0.4a


=== Iridium ===

  This project provides infrastructure to allow static analysis of react based  
  applications.                                                                 
  $ ./iridium <command> [OPTIONS]                                               
  $ ./iridium help                                                              

Command List

  help      Display this information.                        
  analyze   Run static analysis over a project.              
  js3       Generate JS3 file and print to stdout            
  iri       Generate Iridium file (.iri) and print to stdout 
  stats     Codespace stats.                                 
  version   Print the version.                               